Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Admin panel: light-mode fixes, softer filter chips,
 compact phone card

- Reports filter chips and 'load more' use the soft ghost style
  (thick outline looked harsh, especially in day mode)
- App tab chip text follows the accent ink colour (readable in day mode)
- User card facts in two columns on phones; smaller header title

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X3fizJ3F3nvfvUZqdZamcq
---
